-- 358 THE UNDER 7 SHELF: FOUR NEW LESSONS FOR RECEPTION AND KEY STAGE 1.
--
-- Justin, 30 September 2026: "research best lessons out there for under 7s and
-- write them as the best possible lesson." Since PR 1178 a Foundation child's
-- own lessons are the school modules, and there were three. These four take
-- the shelf to seven and reach the Education for a Connected World early years
-- to 7 outcomes the first three did not: health and the stop, privacy and
-- security, online reputation, online relationships.
--
--   eyfs-30 The screen never says stop     CHOOSE  pick a stop, wave bye bye
--   eyfs-31 Paws off, ask first            NOTICE  paws off, look up, ask
--   ks1-32  Private like a toothbrush      CHOOSE  keep, ask, tell
--   ks1-33  Who is on the other side?      NOTICE  someone I know, someone I
--                                                  do not know, or a machine
--
-- Built from what the best under 7 resources do (Childnet's Smartie the
-- Penguin, CEOP's Jessie and Friends, Common Sense K to 2): a friend in a
-- tricky moment and the class decides, a chant with actions, never scary,
-- the move practised with bodies, and the grown up at home closing it. Plan:
-- plans/2026-09-30-under-7-lessons-plan.md. Each passed the module contract,
-- every measurable rubric check and the 12 word wall ceiling before this was
-- written.
--
-- THE SIGN OFF MOVES WITH THEM. ks5-20 closes with a count of the modules
-- that led to it, in teaching order (324 set it to twenty eight). Four lessons
-- teach before it now, so it becomes thirty two. check-lesson-counts.mjs holds
-- the file to it.
--
-- Guarded, in order:
--   1. a backup of the table, with row level security on;
--   2. it stops if any of the four module ids already exists: it only inserts;
--   3. the sign off is rewritten only if it still reads exactly twenty eight;
--   4. each new row is proved against its file: slides, strings, one hash;
--   5. the table grew by exactly four and no other lesson moved except the
--      one line of ks5-20.
--
-- Generated from the module JSON by scripts/module-to-migration.mjs and
-- scripts/module-string-hash.mjs, never by hand.

